Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set Width 1040
Set Height 540
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type "export PS1='❯ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "gopro-yank --version"
Enter
Sleep 900ms

Type "gopro-yank demo --count 8"
Enter
Sleep 4s
